{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "v1-metrics-overview",
  "title": "Expense Tracker — v1 Metrics",
  "tags": [
    "expense-tracker",
    "v1-metrics"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tier",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, tier)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RED metrics — backend",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])) by (route)",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx error rate by route",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) by (route)",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p50 request duration by method & route",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, method, route))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Grouped by (method, route) together, not route alone � POST /expenses/ and GET /expenses/ can have very different latency profiles (a write that hits the DB vs a cached-ish read), and collapsing them into one /expenses/ line would hide that. Three separate panels, one per percentile, rather than three lines on one panel � easier to read when method+route pushes the legend past a handful of entries."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 request duration by method & route",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, method, route))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Grouped by (method, route) together, not route alone � POST /expenses/ and GET /expenses/ can have very different latency profiles (a write that hits the DB vs a cached-ish read), and collapsing them into one /expenses/ line would hide that. Three separate panels, one per percentile, rather than three lines on one panel � easier to read when method+route pushes the legend past a handful of entries."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 request duration by method & route",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
